The defect: `AddressSpace::UNMAP` stops checking `WRITE`, so a capability narrowed to `ENUMERATE`
for `pmap` can take pages out of the space it was only allowed to look at.

Expected to fail: the `NotPermitted` assertion, which gets `Ok(0)`.

